  [PASS] C3 standardization: the headline mu2 slot is the SW01-REGISTERED kernel, verbatim (MUTATE=1 breaks this)   (headline slot = 'mu2_reg'; registered recompute agrees to <1e-14)
  [PASS] C4 L(0.5) exact fractions: mu1 = 2/3, mu2_reg = 8/15, mu2_std = 4/5 (the brief's 'x^2/(1+x^2) -> 0.25??' candidate is REFUTED)   (measured L(0.5): mu1 0.666667, mu2_reg 0.533333, mu2_std 0.800000; x^2/(1+x^2)|0.5 = 0.2 is not any kernel's log-slope (d ln mu2_std/d ln x = 1/(1+x^2) = 0.8))
  [PASS] C5 monotonicity and band: eps_Phi strictly DECREASES with eta over the classical range, all kernels   (d eps/d eta < 0 measured (the closed form's L(0) = 1 -> 0 makes the signal STRONGEST at the smallest e_N, bound (sqrt2-1)/(sqrt2+1) = 0.1716); AQUAL band over the grid: eps in [0.0978, 0.1704] (the brief's 'growing with eta' phrasing is not what the closed form gives -- measured below))

