====================================================================================================================
THE PREDICTION (DE09 decision rule)
====================================================================================================================
  FRAMEWORK (direction-blind, SW01): ZERO field-aligned elongation -- only tidal (orbit-aligned) elongation;
     the phantom shell is spherical (SW01 N1) and the l = 2 residual is tidal, (T r_M/g_ext)^2 ~ 1e-9.
  AQUAL (the closed form): field-aligned elongation of the equipotentials by eps_Phi listed -- a defined band [0.098, 0.170]
     over the classical eta range on BOTH footings; per-dSph values in phase 3 (upper bound on stellar
     isophotal ellipticity if the tracer density follows the potential -- stars respond to the TOTAL gradient).
  VERDICT: no measured dSph ellipticity/position-angle table exists in the repo -- the lane's decision rule
     is delivered and stands as K1/K2/K3 above; the test fires when measurements appear.
  checks: 6/6 PASS

